low as $5.77 and as high as $11.23 during 2019. During this same period, our ordinary share prices have ranged from as low as €9.80 to as high as
€22.32. The market price of our securities may fluctuate significantly in response to numerous factors, many of which are beyond our control, including:
• actual or anticipated fluctuations in our financial condition and operating results;
• actual or anticipated changes in our growth rate relative to our competitors;
